# 统一换行：仓库里存 LF，Windows 上检出成 CRLF（避免每次改动整个文件都算 diff）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 可能解析失败
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制，不做任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk binary

# 语言统计
*.kt text
*.kts text
*.xml text
*.yml text
*.md text
